{"id":"panne","lemma":"panne","pos":"noun","rank":2050,"glosses":["plush velvet","breakdown (state of no longer functioning)","purlin"],"ipa":"/pan/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/1/14/Fr-panne.ogg/Fr-panne.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"pannes"},"formAudio":{"pannes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Mathieu_Kappler-Pannes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La radio est en panne.","en":"The radio is out of order.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"radio, tuner"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"L'ascenseur semble être en panne.","en":"The elevator seems to be out of order.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"lift, elevator"},{"g":"to seem","l":"sembler"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Malheureusement, le téléphone était en panne.","en":"Unfortunately, the telephone was out of order.","words":[{"g":"unfortunately"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"telephone"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"J'avais une panne.","en":"I had a breakdown.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"L’ascenseur est-il encore en panne ?","en":"Is the elevator still out of order?","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"lift, elevator"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"still"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]}]}